r dark because something out there takes children. Have you ever seen one?","zh":"我娘说天黑了不许出门，外面有东西会把小孩叼走。你见过那种东西吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Pilgrims come into the city every day now. The inns have been full for weeks, and plenty of them sleep out on the squares.","zh":"这阵子天天有朝圣的人进城，客栈早就住满了，好多人只能在广场上过夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.incensebarrow-farm.folk3.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.incensebarrow-farm.folk3"}}]}